            "text": "True or False only",
            "kind": "note"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "narration": "Let's run it again. The price prints with the decimal point, and the boolean prints as the word true. These four types cover almost everything a beginner needs to start building apps.",
      "remotion": {
        "type": "TerminalRun",
